# Z5 refinery <-> Z6 power plant gap at x=+179, y=+128 (pipe bridge above)
# Z7 security <-> Z8 rail yard gap at x=+256, y=-64
# Z11 radar <-> Z10 data console gap at x=-192, y=-358

